[00:02.00] 作词 : David Gilmour
[00:02.00][by:无为世界]
[00:02.00] 作曲 : David Gilmour
[02:22.15]The sweet smell of a great sorrow lies over the land
[02:22.15]一股巨大悲伤的醉人气息弥漫这片土地
[02:27.22]Plumes of smoke rise and merge into the leaden sky:
[02:27.22]烟雾腾腾升入铅灰色的天空
[02:32.21]A man lies and dreams of green fields and rivers,
[02:32.21]一个男人满嘴胡话呓语着绿地和河流
[02:36.58]But awakes to a morning with no reason for waking
[02:36.58]晨光中醒来后却浑然不知为何苏醒
[02:42.26]
[02:46.59]He's haunted by the memory of a lost paradise
[02:46.59]他为有关失乐园的记忆魂牵梦萦
[02:51.64]In his youth or a dream, he can't be precise
[02:51.64]是年少时还是梦中他已不甚了然
[02:57.07]He's chained forever to a world that's departed
[02:57.07]他将永远受缚于那分崩离析的世界
[03:01.48]It's not enough, it's not enough
[03:01.48]远不止这些 远不止这些
[03:05.69]
[03:31.82]His blood has frozen & curdled with fright
[03:31.82]他的血液由于惊吓凝固成冰
[03:36.86]His knees have trembled & given way in the night
[03:36.86]他的双膝战战兢兢夜里颓然跪倒
[03:41.43]His hand has weakened at the moment of truth
[03:41.43]他的手在真相揭晓之时恢复知觉
[03:46.90]His step has faltered
[03:46.90]他步履蹒跚
[03:50.76]
[03:57.02]One world, one soul
[03:57.02]一个世界锁住一个灵魂啊
[04:06.46]Time pass, the river rolls
[04:06.46]时间倏逝 河流滚滚
[04:16.52]
[05:16.42]And he talks to the river of lost love and dedication
[05:16.42]他向失去所爱奉献终身的河流娓娓道来
[05:21.57]And silent replies that swirl invitation
[05:21.57]只有寂静回应漩涡的热切邀请
[05:25.90]Flow dark and troubled to an oily sea
[05:25.90]天色渐暗混入油污四浮的海
[05:31.49]A grim intimation of what is to be
[05:31.49]徒生未来如何走的糟糕念头
[05:36.05]
[05:40.52]There's an unceasing wind that blows through this night
[05:40.52]永不间断的风吹拂着夜晚
[05:46.49]And there's dust in my eyes, that blinds my sight
[05:46.49]眼中一粒尘埃遮蔽了我的视线
[05:51.23]And silence that speaks so much louder than words,
[05:51.23]寂静之声远比言语来得猛烈
[05:56.18]Of promises broken
[05:56.18]所谓诺言最终一一破灭
[06:01.41]
